<title>USA: Met-Pro increases annual div $0.27.</title>
<headline>Met-Pro increases annual div $0.27.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYSVILLE, Pa. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Met-Pro Corp said it increased its annual dividend by 23 percent to $0.27 per share from $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 25 to shareholders of record on April 11.</p>
</text>
